#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/camera-bus.rst:2
msgid "Camera Bus"
msgstr "Kamerabusz"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/camera-bus.rst:4
msgid ""
"This bus interfaces with the CMOS camera chip. The CMOS camera board is "
"mounted parallel to the processing part of the board and connects starting "
"at pin 1. The female camera header should be soldered on the back of the "
"main CMUcam3 board. The CMUcam3 works with the OV6620 and OV7630 camera "
"modules."
msgstr ""
"Ez a busz a CMOS kamera-chippel illeszkedik. A CMOS kamerapanel a panel "
"feldolgozó részével párhuzamosan van felszerelve, és az 1. lábnál kezdve "
"csatlakozik. A kamera anya tűsorát a fő CMUcam3 panel hátoldalára kell "
"forrasztani. A CMUcam3 az OV6620 és OV7630 kameramodulokkal működik."

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/camera-bus.rst:9
msgid ""
"(Camera Bus Connection image ``camera-bus.png`` -- not preserved in the "
"archive.)"
msgstr ""
